  "titleText": {
    "es": "Esta hoja exótica fue forjada a partir de una estrella caída distinta. El meteorito era una condrita carbonácea, así que es básicamente un puñado de grava con forma de espada a base de pegamento. ¡Una espada del ESPACIO!",
    "en": "This exotic blade was wrought from a different fallen star. The meteorite was a carbonaceous chondrite, so it's basically a lump of gravel glued into the shape of a sword. A SPACE sword!",
    "noteEn": "The Spanish archive title attribute and the official xkcd #1114 English title attribute are preserved exactly. In the raster, FOR-/JADA, CON-/TIENE, PODE-/RES, and SOBRE-/NATURALES are ordinary line wraps and are each authored as one word; their printed wrap hyphens are punctuation rather than separate units. OCR omitted the plus sign from +2, dropped the accent from CUÁNDO, and read the start of NATURALES incorrectly; the authored transcript follows the Spanish raster."
  },
